context-comparison-title = Context selection · same-turn comparison
context-comparison-hint = c refresh counts · Tab files · PgUp/Dn details · Esc back
context-comparison-source-hint = c compare exact same-turn context · / more
context-comparison-empty = No immutable full-turn receipt yet. Press c to prepare locally; no request is sent.
context-comparison-waiting = Preparing the full request locally. No provider/network call, send approval or billing measurement.
context-comparison-before-only = Previous selection retained; the current full request has not been prepared yet. Press c to refresh.
context-comparison-baseline = Current selection prepared. Change attachments to compare this same turn locally.
context-comparison-scope = Task { $task } · partner { $partner } · { $provider } · { $operation } · local turn { $turn }
context-comparison-counts = Previous: { $previous } captures · current: { $current } captures
context-comparison-section = { $section }: { $previous } → { $current } B ({ $delta } B)
context-comparison-estimate = Local estimate: { $previous } → { $current } tok ({ $delta } tok)
context-comparison-envelope = JSON envelope: { $previous } → { $current } B ({ $delta } B)
context-comparison-total = Full Eevee payload: { $previous } → { $current } B ({ $delta } B)
context-comparison-dedup = Citation markers: { $previous } → { $current } (overlap may change remaining entries)
context-comparison-instructions = Instructions
context-comparison-facts = Task facts
context-comparison-attachments = Attachments
context-comparison-handoff = Handoff
context-comparison-memories = Approved memories
context-comparison-other = Other fields
context-comparison-local = Exact bytes come only from immutable prepared requests. Section values use the receipt's compact JSON accounting; the envelope includes keys, separators and indentation. Estimates round independently.
context-comparison-estimator = Local estimator: eevee-local-v1 — ASCII bytes/4, 1 per CJK/kana/Hangul character, 1 per 2 other characters.
context-comparison-boundary = Counts only; no source-text copies retained. This is not provider usage, effective context, cache savings or billing. Unreported provider usage/billing is unknown, not zero. Dispatch still validates fresh sources and needs ordinary consent.
context-comparison-unavailable = Exact same-turn comparison unavailable; only genuinely prepared current counts may be shown. Local removal remains available. Nothing is sent.
cmd-context-compare = Compare exact context selections for the same turn locally; never send
